<title>UK: Genfinance sets 3.0 bln Lux franc step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Genfinance sets 3.0 bln Lux franc step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg and Genarale de Banque.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENFINANCE LUXEMBOURG SA.</p>
<p> AMT    3.0 BLN LUF   COUPON    *4.25	MATURITY    30.DEC.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.45    PAY DATE    30.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 5.53 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES     *YEARS ONE TO THREE, 6.0 PCT YEARS FOUR TO SIX AND</p>
<p>		THEN 8.0 PCT  YEARS SEVEN TO NINE.</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	DENOMS (K) 50-250</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 PRAECIPUUM 0.25 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR DEBT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
